  <article class="contenu section prose-pf max-w-[900px]">
    <h1>PEAK PITCH terms of sale</h1>
    <h2>The service</h2>
    <p>PEAK PITCH costs €99 per project, exempt from French VAT under Article 261 C of the French General Tax Code. Payment grants access to a guided questionnaire and one generation of three documents: a summary and appendix, a document checklist and a bank presentation.</p>
    <p>After payment, use the personal access link to complete or resume the questionnaire and start the generation. The documents are generated with AI from the information you provide. Check them before sharing them. PEAK FUNDING does not submit your application to lenders. Each lender decides whether to grant credit.</p>
    <h2>Right of withdrawal</h2>
    <p>Consumers have 14 days from the conclusion of the contract to withdraw. For immediate supply of the digital deliverables, the right ends when the deliverables are supplied, subject to express prior consent, acknowledgement of the loss of that right and confirmation on a durable medium. Starting generation alone does not cause loss of that right.</p>
    <ConditionsCommunes en />
